victory3 = "Now where did you take my money to, ya scum?"
victory4 = "At this rate we are never finding the money."
victory5 = "What's next, a flying toilet?"
victory6 = "How many times have I told you my face isn't a fist magnet, Christ."
victory7 = "Well now I feel like garbage, that pile of money, where have you gone?"
victory8 = "Hey... Now this engine wouldn't be too out of place if it was in a Dick Clark special."
victory9 = "Yeah well, I wouldn't have disfigured so much out of your face if you just told me if you seen me money without punching me."
victory10 = "Hopefully after this wraps up we'll all be back and have some pizza together. Ah, yeah you are not invited."
;Vs self
victory11 = "You are stupid, your moves are stupid, and you look stupid."
victory12 = "Well this is most awkward isn't it?"
victory13 = "Nope, I can't do this anymore. I'm out!"
victory14 = "It's like meeting yourself when you were 14, heh. AND I HATED BEING 14!"
victory15 = "Aaaaahh, it's like those beautiful pictures in the honor roll nobody wants to look at."
;Vs real self
victory16 = "Now don't get me wrong, but if there's more than one of us WE SHOULD BOTH JUST CUT THE CRAP AND SEARCH FOR THAT MONEY DAMN IT!"
;Vs Dee Bee Kaw
victory17 = "Well man, look at it this way, we both lost something valuable. Wanna talk this over a few drinks... Not that I drink though."
victory18 = "I didn't touch that hamster cage man all those years ago bro. The only plastic at me house are those action figures."
victory19 = "Look man, I can't afford to waste any more time, talk to you some other time, I'll bring cookies even!"
;Vs George
victory20 = "Say on a scale of 1 to 10, how way cooler are you?"
victory21 = "Well dude, look at it this way. Those bruises will last way less than Full House."
victory22 = "So this is inevitably the point where I have to ask you, have you seen my money?"
victory23 = "Hey George, maybe we should go to the doctor, I think we clearly have some shape problems whenever we move."
victory24 = "Bro, I don't know nothing about some spotlight being taken, but I have heard reports of people stealing those. Stuff's screwed up man."
;Low health
victory25 = "I would really appreciate next time you refuse from both: Hitting my face, or hitting my buttocks; thanks."
victory26 = "See this is the point where I would complain about being hurt and shit. AAAAAAAAAAAAAAUUUURGHHHHHHH HIAAAAAAAUUURGHGHGHHGHFHGHHGHGHHFASjfkgldjfg"
victory27 = "That stung. I'll probably need that money they took to treat these wounds at the hospital now, thanks a lot!"
victory28 = "Just a couple broken bones AGH!!"
victory29 = "Just sing can you feel the sunshine--Just sing can you feel the sunshine--Just sing can you feel the sunshine--"

